lanes in one session.\",\"AC-4.3/TC-4.3: failure classification for auth, invalid_request, rate_limit, timeout, network, and thrown/unknown values is covered, with createModelCall catch returning classified failures.\",\"AC-4.4/TC-4.4: host returns empty text as success and the LHC adapter records empty_output for empty resolved output.\",\"AC-4.5/TC-4.5: captured thread work drains through the scheduler and persists both ready and classified failed outcomes queryable through inspect health/overview.\",\"Architecture-Risk: Concurrency / Lost Update: stale background result is forced and verified not to clobber newer edited state.\",\"Configured gates passed: pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify and pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all.\"],\"unverified\":[]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"productionPathFindings\":[],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"pass\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"Production-path audit found no remaining mockComplete, placeholder completion text, or observeOnlyProvider default in the Story 5 connector runtime path; remaining fake ModelCalls are confined to tests.\"]}"}}
